* CTCAE grade 3-4 polyneuropathy during Bortezomib treatment;
* Allogeneic Stem Cell Transplantation (Allo SCT) planned;
* Progressive disease.'

Exclusion for randomisation 2:

* Progressive disease;
* Neuropathy, except CTCAE grade 1;
* CTCAE grade 3-4 polyneuropathy during Bortezomib treatment.

